scope one keystone -- the ratchet family's open question written as a foundation, with a dead lap recovered ahead of it
status GREEN -- law_guard_heard 22 legs fail=0 after the repair, instrument_refusal green beside it, ratchet_slack control_verdict=ok, foundation B+ 86 at Field with the judged half handed in; cold 242 green 2 red, first hot 243 green 1 red which is the red this lap then closed, second hot pass over the repaired tree reads 244 green, 1 red -- standing_equipment echoing dated_path's recorded %626, which is the protected-tissue answer this lap's own page names and no lap may lower
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- two asks ride on one card now: may a law page cite a guard the roster reaches nowhere, and may a ceiling stand over a population its own lane cannot lower. Both are rulings about what an instrument may promise rather than laps.
